{"sourceUrl":"http://www.cps.zju.edu.cn/2026/0819/c58897a3195610/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:14.177028+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://www.cps.zju.edu.cn/2026/0819/c58897a3195610/page.htm","html":"<div><p><span><span>欢迎外校和本校外院（系）优秀学子申请浙江大学药学院</span><span>2027</span><span>年推免研究生！相关说明通知如下：</span></span></p><p><span>1.</span><span>招收类型：</span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><a href=\"http://www.cps.zju.edu.cn/2026/0819/c58897a3195610/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span>类型</span></strong></a></p></td><td><p><span><strong><span>专业代码</span></strong></span></p></td><td><p><span><strong><span>专业名称</span></strong></span></p></td><td><p><span><strong><span><span>方向</span><span>/</span><span>研究所名称</span></span></strong></span></p></td><td><p><span><strong><span>拟招推免生类型</span></strong></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>学术学位</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>100700</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>药学</span></span></p></td><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span><span><span>按药学一级学科</span><span>/</span><span>领域招生</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>涵盖</span><span>6</span><span>个研究所和安评中心</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>直接攻博</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>专业学位</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>105500</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>药学</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>直接攻博</span><span>/</span><span>专硕</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>专业学位</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>086002</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>制药工程</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>台州研究院新药创制工程项目</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>专硕</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span>备注：其中</span><span>制药工程专业学位学籍为工程师学院。</span></p><p><span> </span><span>2.</span><span>符合条件的申请者须在浙江大学研究生招生服务系统（</span><span><a href=\"https://yjsy.zju.edu.cn/grsinfo/zs/user/login\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>https://yjsy.zju.edu.cn/grsinfo/zs/user/login</span></a></span><span><span>）注册、登录后提交报名申请（申请时间：</span><span>8</span><span>月</span><span>10</span><span>日</span><span>10</span><span>时</span><span>-9</span><span>月</span><span>8</span><span>日</span><span>24</span><span>时），将有效身份证扫描件、本科期间成绩单、外语水平证明、科研成果证明、获奖证明、直博生专家推荐意见等材料合成</span><span>1</span><span>个</span><span>PDF</span><span>文件上传系统。</span></span></p><p><span>3.</span><span><span>申请条件、报名方式和流程等详见“浙江大学关于</span><span>2027</span><span>年接收外校推荐免试研究生工作安排的通知” </span><a href=\"http://www.cps.zju.edu.cn/2026/0819/c58897a3195610/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>http://www.grs.zju.edu.cn/yjszs/2026/0805/c28498a3193539/page.htm</span><span>；如申请本科直博，应具有较高水平的英语能力，原则上大学英语六级</span><span>460</span><span>及以上或</span><span>WSK</span><span>（</span><span>PETS 5</span><span>）合格或英语专业八级合格或英语国家获得过学士及以上学位，成绩有效期五年（指考试时间在</span><span>2022</span><span>年</span><span>6</span><span>月及以后）；或雅思</span><span>5.5</span><span>及以上或托福</span><span>80</span><span>及以上（不认可家考成绩），有效期参照证书的有效期；同时还须提供至少两名报考学科专业领域内副教授及以上职称专家（或相当专业职称的专家）的书面推荐意见</span><span>（</span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/4f2633a725899a136aad.gif\"/></a><a href=\"http://www.cps.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/8e/ef/f1e97aa1487e9785774ca4641791/b9022f6f-d954-4940-b142-55150390f975.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>浙江大学攻读博士学位研究生专家推荐信模板.docx</span></a><span>）。</span></span></p><p><span>4.</span><span>复试名单、复试办法等请关注学院官网、推免系统等后续通知；</span></p><p><span>5.</span><span>导师信息见附件；</span></p><p><span>6.</span><span><span>咨询方式：邮箱：</span><span>0571-88208159   </span></span><span><a href=\"mailto:hzczywj@zju.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>hzczywj@zju.edu.cn</span></a></span><span> </span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/1debb50bb831eaf49262.gif\"/><a href=\"http://www.cps.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/8e/ef/f1e97aa1487e9785774ca4641791/18cbfd9d-36e5-4bba-a6d0-688109c0e68e.xlsx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>附件1：药学院研究生导师信息参考.xlsx</span></a></span></p><p><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/1debb50bb831eaf49262.gif\"/><a href=\"http://www.cps.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/8e/ef/f1e97aa1487e9785774ca4641791/32368df8-6fff-4359-ae0d-7dc9ceaf0f3f.xlsx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>附件2：新药创制工程项目导师信息.xlsx</span></a></span></p><p><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span>   </span></p><p><span> </span><span>药学院</span></p><p><span>  </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span> </span><span>    </span><span>2026</span><span><span>年</span><span>8</span><span>月</span></span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"cce857da937694c73b87f851c5a384d669462014e674f873bb40572d06d54b98","textLength":820,"sourceSha256":"e3c77b1693e9ae95c2151508fdc137016079cc96321c117046c65a80efe5f07b","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-8e2c32b6bccd365fa272","title":"2026年浙江大学药学院关于2027年接收外校、本校外院（系）推荐免试研究生的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:14.177028+00:00","mirroredImages":[{"sourceUrl":"http://www.cps.zju.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif","file":"assets/articles/media/4f2633a725899a136aad.gif"},{"sourceUrl":"http://www.cps.zju.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_xls.gif","file":"assets/articles/media/1debb50bb831eaf49262.gif"},{"sourceUrl":"http://www.cps.zju.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_xls.gif","file":"assets/articles/media/1debb50bb831eaf49262.gif"}]}
